# A range probe bounds the field after those an equality fixes.
use planner

probe plan
  explain from x in follows where x.src == users.key(2) and x.dst > users.key(2) select x.dst
----
Set total
  reads follows.Follow, follows (src, dst)
  Pipeline
    One row
    Range probe follows (src, dst), 1 key equal, lower exclusive, no upper
      Follow ->
        Chain
          Filter
          Emit
